    "article_summary": "The article describes the first light-driven method for the \u03b1-trifluoromethoxylation of ketones using organic photoredox catalysis. By employing enol carbonates as substrates and N-trifluoromethoxy-4-cyanopyridinium (2a) as the radical source with 4-CzIPN as the photocatalyst, the authors achieved chemoselective C-O bond formation. The reaction is applicable to a wide range of substrates, including bioactive targets, and is compatible with both batch and continuous-flow conditions.",
